#. Setup's title bar and taskbar button.
msgctxt "SetupAppTitle"
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "සංරක්ෂක"

#. Setup's title bar and taskbar button.
#. Setup fills in %1 (and %2, ...): keep each one.
#, qt-format
msgctxt "SetupWindowTitle"
msgid "Setup - %1"
msgstr "%1 - සංරක්ෂක"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonBack"
msgid "< &Back"
msgstr "< පෙර"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonNext"
msgid "&Next >"
msgstr "ඉදිරියට >"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonInstall"
msgid "&Install"
msgstr "පිහිටුවීම"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonOK"
msgid "OK"
msgstr "හරි"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonCancel"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "අත්හරින්න"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonYes"
msgid "&Yes"
msgstr "ඔව්"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonNo"
msgid "&No"
msgstr "නැත"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonFinish"
msgid "&Finish"
msgstr "අවසන්"

#. A button on the wizard's pages or its message boxes.
msgctxt "ButtonWizardBrowse"
msgid "B&rowse..."
msgstr "විමසීම..."

#. The Select Setup Language dialog, shown first.
msgctxt "SelectLanguageTitle"
msgid "Select Setup Language"
msgstr "පිහිටුම් භාෂාවක් තෝරන්න"

#. The Select Setup Language dialog, shown first.
msgctxt "SelectLanguageLabel"
msgid "Select the language to use during the installation."
msgstr "පිහිටුවීමේ දී භාවිතා කළයුතු භාෂාවක් තෝරන්න:"

#. The dialog asking whether to install for you only or for all users, shown after the language.
msgctxt "PrivilegesRequiredOverrideTitle"
msgid "Select Setup Install Mode"
msgstr ""

#. The dialog asking whether to install for you only or for all users, shown after the language.
msgctxt "PrivilegesRequiredOverrideInstruction"
msgid "Select install mode"
msgstr ""

#. The dialog asking whether to install for you only or for all users, shown after the language.
#. Setup fills in %1 (and %2, ...): keep each one.
#, qt-format
msgctxt "PrivilegesRequiredOverrideText2"
msgid ""
"%1 can be installed for you only, or for all users (requires administrative "
"privileges)."
msgstr ""

#. The dialog asking whether to install for you only or for all users, shown after the language.
msgctxt "PrivilegesRequiredOverrideCurrentUserRecommended"
msgid "Install for &me only (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#. The dialog asking whether to install for you only or for all users, shown after the language.
msgctxt "PrivilegesRequiredOverrideAllUsers"
msgid "Install for &all users"
msgstr ""

#. The question when you cancel Setup.
msgctxt "ExitSetupTitle"
msgid "Exit Setup"
msgstr "පිහිටුවීමෙන් ඉවත් වන්න"

#. The question when you cancel Setup.
msgctxt "ExitSetupMessage"
msgid ""
"Setup is not complete. If you exit now, the program will not be installed.\n"
"\n"
"You may run Setup again at another time to complete the installation.\n"
"\n"
"Exit Setup?"
msgstr ""
"පිහිටුවීම අසම්පූර්ණයි. ඔබ දැන් ඉවත් වුවහොත් මෘදුකාංගය පිහිටු නොවේවි.\n"
"\n"
"පිහිටුවීම සම්පූර්ණ කිරීමට ඔබට පසුව පිහිටුවීම ධාවනය කළ හැක.\n"
"\n"
"පිහිටුවීමෙන් ඉවත් වන්න ද?"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "WizardSelectDir"
msgid "Select Destination Location"
msgstr "අවසන් පිහිටුම තෝරන්න"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "SelectDirDesc"
msgid "Where should [name] be installed?"
msgstr "[name] පිහිටුවිය යුත්තේ කොහේ ද?"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "SelectDirLabel3"
msgid "Setup will install [name] into the following folder."
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය [name] පහත ෆෝල්ඩරයේ ස්ථාපනය කරයි."

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "SelectDirBrowseLabel"
msgid ""
"To continue, click Next. If you would like to select a different folder, "
"click Browse."
msgstr ""
"ඉදිරියට යාමට, ඉදිරියට ක්ලික් කරන්න. ඔබට වෙනත් ෆෝල්ඩරයක් තේරීමට ඔබට අවශ්‍යනම්, විමසීම ක්ලික් කරන්න."

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "DiskSpaceMBLabel"
msgid "At least [mb] MB of free disk space is required."
msgstr "පිහිටුවීමට අවම  [mb] මෙබ හිස් තැටි අවකාශයක් තිබිය යුතුයි."

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "BrowseDialogTitle"
msgid "Browse For Folder"
msgstr "ෆෝල්ඩර තෝරන්න"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "BrowseDialogLabel"
msgid "Select a folder in the list below, then click OK."
msgstr "පහත ලැයිස්තුවෙන් ෆෝල්ඩරයක් තෝරා හරි ක්ලික් කරන්න."

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "ButtonNewFolder"
msgid "&Make New Folder"
msgstr "නව ෆෝල්ඩරයක් තනන්න"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "NewFolderName"
msgid "New Folder"
msgstr "නව ෆෝල්ඩරයක්"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
msgctxt "DirExistsTitle"
msgid "Folder Exists"
msgstr "ෆෝල්ඩරය පවතියි"

#. The Select Destination Location page, its Browse dialog and the question when the chosen folder exists.
#. Setup fills in %1 (and %2, ...): keep each one.
#, qt-format
msgctxt "DirExists"
msgid ""
"The folder:\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"already exists. Would you like to install to that folder anyway?"
msgstr ""
"ෆෝල්ඩරය:\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"දැනටමත් පවතියි. එම ෆෝල්ඩරටම ස්ථාපනය කරන්න ද?"

#. The Select Start Menu Folder page.
msgctxt "WizardSelectProgramGroup"
msgid "Select Start Menu Folder"
msgstr "ආරම්භක මෙනු ෆෝල්ඩරය තෝරන්න"

#. The Select Start Menu Folder page.
msgctxt "SelectStartMenuFolderDesc"
msgid "Where should Setup place the program's shortcuts?"
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය මෘදුකාංගයේ කෙටිමං කොහේ ස්ථාපනය කළ යුතු ද?"

#. The Select Start Menu Folder page.
msgctxt "SelectStartMenuFolderLabel3"
msgid ""
"Setup will create the program's shortcuts in the following Start menu folder."
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය මෘදුකාංගයේ කෙටිමං පහත ආරම්භක මෙනු ෆෝල්ඩරයේ සකසයි."

#. The Select Start Menu Folder page.
msgctxt "SelectStartMenuFolderBrowseLabel"
msgid ""
"To continue, click Next. If you would like to select a different folder, "
"click Browse."
msgstr ""
"ඉදිරියට යාමට, මීළඟ ක්ලික් කරන්න. වෙනත් ෆෝල්ඩරයක් තේරීමට, විමසීම ක්ලික් කරන්න."

#. The Select Additional Tasks page.
msgctxt "WizardSelectTasks"
msgid "Select Additional Tasks"
msgstr "අමතර කාර්යයන් තේරීම"

#. The Select Additional Tasks page.
msgctxt "SelectTasksDesc"
msgid "Which additional tasks should be performed?"
msgstr "තවත් කුමන අමතර කාරයයන් සිදුකළ යුතු ද?"

#. The Select Additional Tasks page.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "SelectTasksLabel2"
msgid ""
"Select the additional tasks you want Setup to perform while installing "
"[name], then click Next."
msgstr ""
"[name] ස්ථාපනයේ දී සිදුකළ යුතු අමතර කාර්යයන් තෝරන්න, පසුව මීළඟ ක්ලික් කරන්න."

#. The Select Additional Tasks page: the desktop shortcut, and the heading above it.
msgctxt "AdditionalIcons"
msgid "Additional shortcuts:"
msgstr "අමතර කෙටිමං:"

#. The Select Additional Tasks page: the desktop shortcut, and the heading above it.
msgctxt "CreateDesktopIcon"
msgid "Create a &desktop shortcut"
msgstr "ඩෙස්ක්ටොප් කෙටිමඟක් සකසන්න"

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
msgctxt "WizardReady"
msgid "Ready to Install"
msgstr "ස්ථාපනයට සූදානම්"

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "ReadyLabel1"
msgid "Setup is now ready to begin installing [name] on your computer."
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය [name] ඔබගේ පරිගණකයේ ස්ථාපනයට දැන් සූදානම්."

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
msgctxt "ReadyLabel2a"
msgid ""
"Click Install to continue with the installation, or click Back if you want "
"to review or change any settings."
msgstr ""
"ස්ථාපනයට ස්ථාපනය ක්ලික් කරන්න, සැකසුම් විමර්ෂණයට හෝ වෙනස් කිරීමට පසුපස ක්ලික් කරන්න."

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
msgctxt "ReadyMemoDir"
msgid "Destination location:"
msgstr "අවසන් පිහිටුවීම:"

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
msgctxt "ReadyMemoGroup"
msgid "Start menu folder:"
msgstr "ආරම්භක මෙනු ෆෝල්ඩරය:"

#. The Ready to Install page, and its summary of what you chose.
msgctxt "ReadyMemoTasks"
msgid "Additional tasks:"
msgstr "අමතර කාර්යයන්:"

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
msgctxt "WizardPreparing"
msgid "Preparing to Install"
msgstr "ස්ථාපනයට සූදානම් වෙමින්"

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "PreparingDesc"
msgid "Setup is preparing to install [name] on your computer."
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය [name] ඔබගේ පරිගණකයේ ස්ථාපනයට සූදානම් වෙමින්."

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
msgctxt "ApplicationsFound2"
msgid ""
"The following applications are using files that need to be updated by Setup. "
"It is recommended that you allow Setup to automatically close these "
"applications. After the installation has completed, Setup will attempt to "
"restart the applications."
msgstr ""
"පහත මෘදුකාංග, ස්ථාපකය හට යාවත්කාලීන කළ යුතු ගොනු භාවිතා කරමින් පවතියි. ස්ථාපකයට මෙම මෘදුකාංග "
"ස්වයංක්‍රියව අවසන් කිරීමට ලබාදීම නිර්දේෂ කරයි. ස්ථාපනය අවසන් වූ පසු ස්ථාපකය මෙම මෘදුකාංග නැවත "
"ආරම්භ කිරීමට වෑයම් කරයි."

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
msgctxt "CloseApplications"
msgid "&Automatically close the applications"
msgstr "මෘදුකාංග ස්වයංක්‍රියව අවසන් කරන්න"

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
msgctxt "DontCloseApplications"
msgid "&Do not close the applications"
msgstr "මෘදුකාංග අවසන් නො කරන්න"

#. The Preparing to Install page, shown when Virtaal is running while you upgrade it.
msgctxt "ErrorCloseApplications"
msgid ""
"Setup was unable to automatically close all applications. It is recommended "
"that you close all applications using files that need to be updated by Setup "
"before continuing."
msgstr ""
"ස්ථාපකය හට ස්වයංක්‍රියව මෘදුකාංග අවසන් කළ නොහැකි විය. ඉදිරියට යාමට පෙර මෙම ගොනු භාවිතා කරන "
"මෘදුකාංග වසා දැමීම නිර්දේෂ කරයි."

#. The Installing page, and its progress messages.
msgctxt "WizardInstalling"
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "ස්ථාපනය කරමින්"

#. The Installing page, and its progress messages.
#. [name] and [name/ver] are Virtaal's name (and version): keep them as they are.
msgctxt "InstallingLabel"
msgid "Please wait while Setup installs [name] on your computer."
msgstr "ස්ථාපකය [name] ඔබගේ පරිගණකයේ ස්ථාපනය කරන තුරු මඳක් රැඳී සිටින්න."

#. The Installing page, and its progress messages.
msgctxt "StatusClosingApplications"
msgid "Closing applications..."
msgstr "මෘදුකාංග වසමින්..."

#. The Installing page, and its progress messages.
